   "type": "raw",
   "html": "<p>Datenimport</p> <h2>Werkzeugverwaltung leicht gemacht</h2> <p>Alle Werkzeugdaten führender Werkzeughersteller und Kataloge in der Cloud sind </p> <p>mit den ZOLLER TMS Tool Management Solutions nur einen Mausklick entfernt! </p> <p>Bauen Sie Ihre eigene Datenbank auf.</p> <img alt=\"\" height=\"60\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/fileadmin/_processed_/c/f/csm_Bild_10_5b04ea4a68.webp\" width=\"234\"/> <img alt=\"\" height=\"100\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/fileadmin/_processed_/a/9/csm_Bild_11_f168ce9542.webp\" width=\"201\"/> <img alt=\"\" height=\"126\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/fileadmin/_processed_/f/0/csm_Bild_12_d933aba930.webp\" width=\"235\"/> <img alt=\"\" height=\"77\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/fileadmin/_processed_/b/d/csm_Bild_13_7bbdca66b6.webp\" width=\"252\"/> <img alt=\"\" height=\"60\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/fileadmin/_processed_/4/c/csm_Bild_14_5dd4dc83c8.webp\" width=\"237\"/> <img alt=\"\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/fileadmin/_processed_/a/e/csm_Bild_15_38182efd3f.webp\" width=\"200\"/>",
